1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/llm/cross-entropy-loss","children":["大白话解释交叉熵损失"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"article-hero article-cover","children":["$","img",null,{"className":"u-photo","src":"https://hedon.top/hedonspace/banner/cross-entropy-loss.jpg","alt":"大白话解释交叉熵损失 的文章封面"}]}],["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"大模型"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"大白话解释交叉熵损失"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"本篇从 LLM 训练过程概述开始，通过\"教学徒写文章\"的生动比喻，帮助读者理解交叉熵损失在机器学习中的核心作用，以及如何用它来评估和优化模型的预测能力。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2025-08-13T19:30:20.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2025/08/13"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","3,972"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"llm-训练过程概述","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#llm-训练过程概述","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#llm-训练过程概述"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"LLM 训练过程概述","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":4,"offset":3},"end":{"line":1,"column":14,"offset":13}}}]},"children":"LLM 训练过程概述"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["$","$L8","img-0",{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/image-20250813193726179.png","alt":"LLM 训练过程概述","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"img","properties":{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/image-20250813193726179.png","alt":"LLM 训练过程概述"},"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1,"offset":15},"end":{"line":3,"column":94,"offset":108}}}}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":["在介绍交叉熵损失之前，我们先参考 ",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://github.com/rasbt/LLMs-from-scratch/blob/main/ch05/01_main-chapter-code/ch05.ipynb","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://github.com/rasbt/LLMs-from-scratch/blob/main/ch05/01_main-chapter-code/ch05.ipynb"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Build a Large Language Model","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":19,"offset":128},"end":{"line":5,"column":47,"offset":156}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":18,"offset":127},"end":{"line":5,"column":139,"offset":248}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"Build a Large Language Model"}]," 一书梳理一下训练 LLM 的核心过程。笔者并非这个方向的专业人士，只能尝试从自己理解的角度来尽可能用大白话阐述这个过程在做什么、为什么这么做、能达到什么效果。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":["为了便于理解，我们可以把整个过程想象成",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"教一个学徒如何写文章"}],"。"]}],"\n",["$","h3","h3-0",{"id":"1-文本生成text-generation","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#1-文本生成text-generation","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#1-文本生成text-generation"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"1. 文本生成（Text generation）","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":5,"offset":370},"end":{"line":9,"column":29,"offset":394}}}]},"children":"1. 文本生成（Text generation）"}]}],"\n",["$","blockquote","blockquote-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"这就像让你的学徒开始写文章。一开始，它什么都不懂，只会胡乱地写一些词语。你给它一个开头，比如\"从前有座山...\"，它可能随便接上\"...山里有只大象在跳舞。\"完全不合逻辑。"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":"这是模型还没有训练好时，它根据一些输入，随机生成的一段文本。它生成的文本质量很差，毫无章法。"}],"\n",["$","h3","h3-1",{"id":"2-文本评估text-evaluation","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#2-文本评估text-evaluation","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#2-文本评估text-evaluation"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"2. 文本评估（Text evaluation）","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":5,"offset":538},"end":{"line":15,"column":29,"offset":562}}}]},"children":"2. 文本评估（Text evaluation）"}]}],"\n",["$","blockquote","blockquote-1",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["你现在需要一个**\"老师\"",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"来给这个学徒写的文章打分。你拿着学徒写的文章，和一篇"}],"标准答案（正确文章）",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"进行对比。这个“老师”会告诉你，学徒写的文章和标准答案之间有多大的差距。这个打分的过程，就是我们本文将提到的"}],"交叉熵损失（Cross-Entropy Loss）**。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-4",{"children":["这个步骤是计算模型生成的文本与真实文本之间的损失值。模型会计算出它对下一个词的预测概率，并用交叉熵损失来衡量这个预测概率与真实词的“独热编码”概率有多大差距。","$L9","。"]}],"\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d","\n","$L2e","\n","$L2f","\n","$L30","\n","$L31","\n","$L32","\n","$L33","\n","$L34","\n","$L35","\n","$L36","\n","$L37","\n","$L38","\n","$L39","\n","$L3a","\n","$L3b","\n","$L3c","\n","$L3d","\n","$L3e","\n","$L3f","\n","$L40","\n","$L41","\n","$L42","\n","$L43","\n","$L44","\n","$L45","\n","$L46","\n","$L47","\n","$L48","\n","$L49","\n","$L4a","\n","$L4b","\n","$L4c","\n","$L4d","\n","$L4e","\n","$L4f","\n","$L50","\n","$L51","\n","$L52","\n","$L53","\n","$L54"]}]}],"$L55","$L56","$L57"]}],"$L58"]}]]}]}]
