9:["$","font","font-0",{"color":"red","children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"损失值越大，说明模型预测得越差"}]}]
a:["$","h3","h3-2",{"id":"3-训练集和验证集的损失training-set-and-validation-set-losses","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#3-训练集和验证集的损失training-set-and-validation-set-losses","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#3-训练集和验证集的损失training-set-and-validation-set-losses"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"3. 训练集和验证集的损失（Training set and validation set losses）","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":5,"offset":837},"end":{"line":21,"column":58,"offset":890}}}]},"children":"3. 训练集和验证集的损失（Training set and validation set losses）"}]}]
b:["$","blockquote","blockquote-2",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["你的学徒现在开始正式学习了。你给他一大堆文章（",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"训练集"}],"）让他模仿学习，然后定期拿出一小部分它没看过的文章（",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"验证集"}],"）给他做测试。"]}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"训练集损失："}]," 衡量学徒在学习过程中，对那些它看过的文章模仿得有多像。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"验证集损失："}]," 衡量学徒在面对新文章时，能不能把学到的东西举一反三，而不是只会死记硬背。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}]
c:["$","p","p-5",{"children":["如果训练集损失一直下降，但验证集损失不降反升，那就说明学徒只会\"死记硬背\"了，这在机器学习里叫做",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"过拟合（Overfitting）"}],"。"]}]
d:["$","h3","h3-3",{"id":"4-大语言模型训练函数llm-training-function","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#4-大语言模型训练函数llm-training-function","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#4-大语言模型训练函数llm-training-function"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"4. 大语言模型训练函数（LLM training function）","position":{"start":{"line":30,"column":5,"offset":1138},"end":{"line":30,"column":40,"offset":1173}}}]},"children":"4. 大语言模型训练函数（LLM training function）"}]}]
e:["$","p","p-6",{"children":["这就是学徒的**\"大脑\"",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":["，也是整个学习的核心。它根据\"老师\"给出的分数（损失值），调整自己的\"大脑结构\"（模型参数/权重）。如果某篇文章写得不好，它就会\"反思\"自己为什么写不好，然后调整下一次的写作方式，争取写得更好。这个调整的过程叫做",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://hedon.top/2025/07/27/llm/back-propagation/","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://hedon.top/2025/07/27/llm/back-propagation/"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"反向传播（Backpropagation）","position":{"start":{"line":32,"column":124,"offset":1298},"end":{"line":32,"column":145,"offset":1319}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":32,"column":122,"offset":1296},"end":{"line":32,"column":147,"offset":1321}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":32,"column":121,"offset":1295},"end":{"line":32,"column":200,"offset":1374}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"反向传播（Backpropagation）"}]}],"和"]}],"梯度下降（Gradient Descent）**。"]}]
f:["$","h3","h3-4",{"id":"5-训练模型生成类似人类的文本train-the-model-to-generate-human-like-text","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#5-训练模型生成类似人类的文本train-the-model-to-generate-human-like-text","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#5-训练模型生成类似人类的文本train-the-model-to-generate-human-like-text"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"5. 训练模型生成类似人类的文本（Train the model to generate human-like text）","position":{"start":{"line":34,"column":5,"offset":1408},"end":{"line":34,"column":66,"offset":1469}}}]},"children":"5. 训练模型生成类似人类的文本（Train the model to generate human-like text）"}]}]
10:["$","p","p-7",{"children":"这就是整个训练的目的：通过不断地重复第 1-4 步，让学徒的写作能力越来越强，最终写出来的文章，就像人类写的一样自然、流畅。"}]
11:["$","h3","h3-5",{"id":"6-文本生成策略text-generation-strategies","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#6-文本生成策略text-generation-strategies","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#6-文本生成策略text-generation-strategies"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"6. 文本生成策略（Text generation strategies）","position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":5,"offset":1539},"end":{"line":38,"column":42,"offset":1576}}}]},"children":"6. 文本生成策略（Text generation strategies）"}]}]
12:["$","blockquote","blockquote-3",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"学徒学得差不多了，但有时候会变得特别死板，只会把训练集里的东西原封不动地背出来。为了让它更有创意，更像人，你需要教它一些“写作技巧”。"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"例如： 有时候，你不要总是选那个最有可能出现的词，可以偶尔选一些稍微不那么确定，但也很合理的词。"}],"\n"]}]
13:["$","p","p-8",{"children":["这就是像",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Top-k 采样"}],"、",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"Top-p（核）采样"}],"、**温度（Temperature）**调节等技术。这些方法会让模型在生成文本时，增加一些随机性，避免总是生成重复、机械化的内容，减少过拟合的风险。"]}]
14:["$","h3","h3-6",{"id":"7-权重保存和加载weight-saving--loading","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#7-权重保存和加载weight-saving--loading","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#7-权重保存和加载weight-saving--loading"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"7. 权重保存和加载（Weight saving & loading）","position":{"start":{"line":46,"column":5,"offset":1813},"end":{"line":46,"column":40,"offset":1848}}}]},"children":"7. 权重保存和加载（Weight saving & loading）"}]}]
15:["$","p","p-9",{"children":"学徒经过了长期的学习，终于成才了！现在你需要把它的\"大脑\"状态（也就是模型参数）保存下来。这样，下次再用的时候，就不用从头开始教了，直接把这个保存好的\"大脑\"拿出来用就行。"}]
16:["$","h3","h3-7",{"id":"8-来自-openai-的预训练权重pretrained-weights-from-openai","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#8-来自-openai-的预训练权重pretrained-weights-from-openai","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#8-来自-openai-的预训练权重pretrained-weights-from-openai"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"8. 来自 OpenAI 的预训练权重（Pretrained weights from OpenAI）","position":{"start":{"line":50,"column":5,"offset":1942},"end":{"line":50,"column":56,"offset":1993}}}]},"children":"8. 来自 OpenAI 的预训练权重（Pretrained weights from OpenAI）"}]}]
17:["$","p","p-10",{"children":"这就像你不是从一个零基础的学徒开始教，而是直接找一个已经很有经验的\"天才学徒\"来培养。OpenAI 训练了海量的数据，已经把一个 GPT 模型训练得非常强大了。我们直接拿来用，再结合自己的任务，在它的基础上继续微调。这样不仅省时省力，还能得到一个更好的模型。"}]
18:["$","h3","h3-8",{"id":"总结","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#总结","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#总结"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"总结","position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":5,"offset":2130},"end":{"line":54,"column":7,"offset":2132}}}]},"children":"总结"}]}]
19:["$","p","p-11",{"children":"GPT 的训练过程就是，让一个初出茅庐的学徒（模型）写文章，找一个老师（损失函数）给它打分，然后根据分数调整它的大脑（参数）。反复这个过程，直到它写出来的文章像人类一样。为了让它更有创意，我们还教它一些写作技巧。最后，我们会把它的\"大脑\"保存下来，或者直接用一个\"天才学徒\"的大脑，在上面继续学习。"}]
