58:["$","$L78",null,{"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"LLM 训练过程概述","id":"llm-训练过程概述"},{"depth":3,"text":"1. 文本生成（Text generation）","id":"1-文本生成text-generation"},{"depth":3,"text":"2. 文本评估（Text evaluation）","id":"2-文本评估text-evaluation"},{"depth":3,"text":"3. 训练集和验证集的损失（Training set and validation set losses）","id":"3-训练集和验证集的损失training-set-and-validation-set-losses"},{"depth":3,"text":"4. 大语言模型训练函数（LLM training function）","id":"4-大语言模型训练函数llm-training-function"},{"depth":3,"text":"5. 训练模型生成类似人类的文本（Train the model to generate human-like text）","id":"5-训练模型生成类似人类的文本train-the-model-to-generate-human-like-text"},{"depth":3,"text":"6. 文本生成策略（Text generation strategies）","id":"6-文本生成策略text-generation-strategies"},{"depth":3,"text":"7. 权重保存和加载（Weight saving & loading）","id":"7-权重保存和加载weight-saving--loading"},{"depth":3,"text":"8. 来自 OpenAI 的预训练权重（Pretrained weights from OpenAI）","id":"8-来自-openai-的预训练权重pretrained-weights-from-openai"},{"depth":3,"text":"总结","id":"总结"},{"depth":2,"text":"交叉熵损失","id":"交叉熵损失"},{"depth":3,"text":"1. 概念：交叉熵损失，就是给\"猜词\"打分","id":"1-概念交叉熵损失就是给猜词打分"},{"depth":3,"text":"2. 由来：从信息论到机器学习的\"迁移\"","id":"2-由来从信息论到机器学习的迁移"},{"depth":4,"text":"2.1 熵（Entropy）","id":"21-熵entropy"},{"depth":4,"text":"2.2 交叉熵（Cross-Entropy）","id":"22-交叉熵cross-entropy"},{"depth":3,"text":"3. 原理：为什么 −log(p) 是一个好的损失函数？","id":"3-原理为什么-logp-是一个好的损失函数"},{"depth":4,"text":"3.1 数学角度","id":"31-数学角度"},{"depth":4,"text":"3.2 直觉角度","id":"32-直觉角度"},{"depth":3,"text":"4. 计算","id":"4-计算"}]}]
